            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "Shared online that day",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;dossierNote&quot; data-layer=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLayer&quot;&gt;Open sources&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierTitle&quot;&gt;Shared online that day&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After MH17 came down, photographs and videos of a Buk on a red low-loader were shared online. For each, the place where it was taken could be confirmed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bellingcat.com/news/uk-and-europe/2015/10/08/mh17-the-open-source-evidence/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Bellingcat: MH17 – The Open Source Evidence ↗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
            }
        }
    },
