            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "Snizhne, before the crash",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;dossierNote&quot; data-layer=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLayer&quot;&gt;Open sources&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierTitle&quot;&gt;Snizhne, before the crash&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One photograph and one video show the launcher unloaded and driving under its own power. An AP reporter had described a Buk in the town in a report published before MH17 was shot down.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
            }
        }
    },
